  "title": "Zesty Smoked Ethiopian Lamb Kik Alicha",
  "description": "A flavorful and spicy Ethiopian dish made with smoked paprika and lamb, served with a side of cheese for a creamy pull.",
  "cuisine": "Ethiopian",
