      "amount": "2 tablespoons"
    },
    {
      "name": "feta cheese",
      "amount": "1/2 cup",
      "notes": "crumbly"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Heat the butter in a large saucepan over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for an additional minute.",
    "Add the lamb pieces and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the smoked paprika, berbere spice, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Add 1 cup of water to the saucepan and bring to a simmer.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and let cook, covered, for 20 minutes.",
    "Stir in the crumbled feta cheese and let cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Serve the lamb hot, with the cheese pull on top."
